OUR STAGE\n\u2022 Instruments stand in your own room (passthrough). Hug a drum to lift it, put it on your lap, leave it in the air.\n\u2022 Bring in several instruments at once, each with its own sound.\n\u2022 Every drum kit in its own finish, cymbals that answer the tip and the shaft of the stick.\n\u2022 A dimmer for your room.\n\u2022 A mixer for every drum, room reverb and echo, and a hit-sensitivity control.\n\nFree. No ads. No account. English and Arabic.\n\nAlso on Android phones and tablets: Real Darbuka on Google Play.", "short_description": "Play the darbuka and hand drums in your own room, with your hands."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/realdarbukaprivacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "mBibas", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/realdarbukaprivacy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1535743632944924"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1597315305761151"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1597315305761151"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1795206600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1597315305761151"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_resul